title: "CNRS Scientific Toolkit"
message: "CNRS Scientific Toolkit v0.20.0 contains experimental exact finite CNRS-H coefficient and divided-power arithmetic, qualified interoperability and bounded operations. The Python backend is not Lean-extracted or formally verified end-to-end; cite the published version record when available."
